### Label copy convention

- **English-first.** Page / section eyebrows are short **UPPERCASE English** (`CREATE`, `CHASSIS PLATE`, `BUYER`, `PRICING`, `LEDGER`, `GLOSSARY`).
- Do **not** prefix every header with Japanese (`伝票作成  ·  CREATE`, etc.) — that reads as decoration, not signal.
- Japanese is fine only where it is the data itself (glossary JP term, raw auction text, Translate JP → EN).
- Nav links stay English (`Create Invoice`, `Vehicles & History`, …).
- DataGrid column headers: short **UPPERCASE English** (CODE, NUMBER, MAKE…).

## Layout components (reuse; do not reinvent)

### `Controls/PageHeader`

Properties: `Eyebrow`, `Title`, `Subtitle`.

Use at the **top of every main view**. **Compact:** eyebrow + title on **one row**, short subtitle, tight hairline (`Margin` ~0,0,0,8). Do not restore the tall stacked H1 block.

### `Controls/SectionHeader`

Properties: `Eyebrow`, `Title`, `TrailingContent`.

**Compact:** eyebrow + title on one row with Ruri ink tick + tight rule. Prefer this over reinventing section chrome.

### Surface styles

| Style | Use |
|-------|-----|
| `ChassisPlateCardStyle` | Chassis Code/Number block — Asagi fill, Ruri left border `4,1,1,1` |
| `CardSurfaceStyle` | White cards / toolbars / detail panes |
| `FrostChromeStyle` | Translucent wash behind nav buttons / offline chip on dark chrome (**no BlurEffect**) |
| `SuccessBadgeStyle` | Auto-lookup badge / Classic Outlook connected |
| `DangerBannerStyle` | Duplicate chassis alert |
| `WarningBannerStyle` | Glossary / offline email mode callouts |
| `ChassisTextBoxStyle` | Chassis inputs only |
| `PathTextBoxStyle` | Settings path fields |
| `SourceTextExpanderStyle` | Collapsed JP→EN expander chrome |

### Create Invoice page layout (locked)

1. `PageHeader` (compact)
2. SOURCE toolbar + Outlook status badge (Tokiwa if Classic running; Yamabuki offline)
3. Chassis plate card
4. **Buyer | Pricing** side-by-side cards (not a left/right source|fields split)
5. **Vehicle** full-width card
6. **JP → EN** raw source at the **bottom**, `Expander` **collapsed by default**; text box uses `SourceMonoTextBoxStyle` and must stretch/align under the section content
7. Prefer one page `ScrollViewer`; forward wheel from nested multiline boxes when they have no overflow

### Shell / navigation

- Left rail: **gradient** Kachi→Ai wash; brand = **logo** (`logo-128.png`) + `BrandDisplayStyle` + `BrandEyebrowStyle` (`Invoice Desk`).
- Nav buttons: frosted tint pills (`FrostChromeStyle`) + light `SidebarTextBrush` — no Gaussian blur layers.
- Title bar: `TitleBarGradientBrush`; **`ButtonsForeground` = `SidebarTextBrush`**, **`ButtonsBackground` = frost strong** so min/max/close stay readable on dark indigo.
- Content host: `AppBackgroundBrush` with compact padding (~14,8).
- Window fit: clamp to `SystemParameters.WorkArea` on startup (`MainWindow.FitToWorkingArea`).
- Window / taskbar icon: `Assets/app.ico` via `ApplicationIcon` + `Icon="pack://application:,,,/CarInvoice;component/Assets/app.ico"`.

### App logo assets

| Path | Role |
|------|------|
| `Design/logo-master.png` | Transparent square master (≥1024) — edit here, not lossy copies |
| `scripts/generate-logo-assets.py` | Regenerates derived files |
| `Assets/logo-512.png` | README / large use |
| `Assets/logo-128.png` | In-app (sidebar, title bar ImageIcon) |
| `Assets/app.ico` | Multi-size 16–256 — exe, window, taskbar |

- Keep PNGs **transparent** (no baked white/black plate). If UI needs a tile, wrap in XAML `Border`.
- Pack URIs use assembly name **`CarInvoice`**: `pack://application:,,,/CarInvoice;component/Assets/…`
- Prefer a **tight crop** in the master so 16/32 ICO frames read large on the taskbar.

### DataGrids

- `CanUserSortColumns="True"` by default; set `CanUserSort="False"` on action/delete columns.
- Set `SortMemberPath` on nested bindings (e.g. `Customer.FullName`).
- Column header template shows **⇅** when sortable, **▲** / **▼** when sorted — do not remove the sort glyphs.
- Header background stays Kachi indigo wash from the theme template.

## Scrolling

- Prefer **one page `ScrollViewer`** for long forms (Create Invoice). Avoid nested ScrollViewers that steal the wheel.
- Multiline TextBoxes may scroll locally only while they still have overflow; otherwise forward wheel to the page scroller (see `CreateInvoiceView`).

## Accent lock (Wpf.Ui)

Primary buttons use system accent resources. App startup **must** keep:

```csharp
ApplicationAccentColorManager.Apply(AccentAiIro, AccentAiIro, AccentAiIroHover, AccentRuriIro);
theme.SetTheme(ApplicationTheme.Light);
theme.SetAccent(AccentAiIro);
```

Never reintroduce `ApplySystemAccent()`.

## When editing UI

1. New page → start with compact `PageHeader`; new in-card block → compact `SectionHeader`.
2. New color role → add Color + Brush to `JapaneseTheme.xaml` **and** a row in the palette table above before using it.
3. Prefer `{StaticResource ...}` over leftover Wpf.Ui generic brushes for surfaces/text this theme defines.
4. Keep motion subtle if added; hierarchy comes from type + ink ticks + rules + indigo gradient, not glow/pills/purple gradients/`BlurEffect`.
5. Do not reintroduce bilingual JP · EN eyebrows or Yu Gothic path fields.
